WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Open Fusion Settings → Recorder

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Choose the frame rate for your next recording

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose desktop audio, microphone, or no audio

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Preview a filename using date, time, and monitor tokens

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Apply recording options when ready · Alt + F9 starts and stops

